</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d11fc4ac-ddc2-11f1-966c-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-121133-121335-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d11fc4ac-ddc2-11f1-966c-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-121133-121335-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d6582a54-ddc2-11f1-9b30-cd4db83ef990</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:53:43 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>France marks Armistice Day : Macron attends commemorative ceremony</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/france-marks-armistice-day-macron-attends-commemorative-ceremony</link><description>
